                    "@value": "The Agent class aggregates information about attributes or characteristics of agents (persons, organizations or software). Agent information serves to identify an agent unambiguously from all other Agent entities.\n<br>\n• May hold or grant one or more rights.\n<br>\n• May carry out, authorize, or compel one or more events.\n<br>\n• May create or act upon one or more objects through an event or with respect to a rights\nstatement."
                },
                {
                    "@language": "fi",
                    "@value": "Keskinäisessä toiminnassa mukana oleva aktiivinen osallinen, joka voidaan yksilöidä."
                }
            ],
            "@type": "sh:NodeShape"
        },
